Workflows & Automation
Recruitment Flow: Job Creation → Posting → Applications → Screening → Interviews → Offers → Hiring

Interview Request Flow: Request Creation → HR Review → Approve/Suggest/Decline → Notification → Confirmation

Issue Management Flow: AI Detection → Alert Generation → Assignment → Investigation → Action → Resolution

Onboarding Flow: Offer Acceptance → Documentation → Equipment → Training → Mentor → Completion

Performance Review Flow: Cycle Start → Self Assessment → Manager Review → Feedback → Goal Setting → Approval

