Summary for Architecture Design
System Type: Enterprise Web Application (React + Tailwind CSS)

Architecture Pattern: Modular SPA with component-based design

Key Technology Stack:

Frontend: React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4
Routing: React Router (Data mode)
Charts: Recharts
State Management: React Hooks (useState, useRef)
UI Components: Custom components + Lucide React icons
Database Considerations:

Relational database (PostgreSQL recommended)
JSON fields for flexible data (metrics, timelines, configurations)
Time-series data for performance tracking
Audit trail tables for compliance
Search optimization for candidates and employees
Scalability Needs:

Support 1000+ employees
Handle 500+ concurrent users
Process 10,000+ candidates annually
Real-time notifications
Background job processing for AI analytics
